        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana BBS2008, Solid Brass Sobe Series Towel Ring</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nCrafted out of solid brass, the Sobe Series Towel Ring features concealed screw mounting for a sleek contemporary look. The modern styling means it will look good in even the most fashionable homes. It is large enough for the thickest full-sized towels but not so bulky that hand towels would look out of place hanging from it.This bathroom towel ring is made with the attention to quality that Deltana is known for.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-BBS2008-specifications.gif?v=1704354522\" width=\"561\" height=\"254\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana BBS2008 Towel Ring Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nShop more of the <a href=\"/search?type=product&q=Deltana BBS Sobe Series\"><b>Deltana Sobe Series Bathroom Accessories</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> of the Sobe Bathroom or Kitchen Towel Ring:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Diameter: 5-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 7-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Width: 6-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Projection: 5-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Wall Mount Diameter: 1-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Concealed screw mounting for a clean, contemporary look.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-BBS2008.pdf?v=1691095382\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana BBS2008 Towel Ring Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Sold Individually.</b> Package includes: 1 towel ring, mounting screw cover, and all necessary mounting screws.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>This is a Limited Series. <b>Limited Quantities Available</b></i>\r\n</p>",
